                "493: ",
                "494: ### Obtaining ZohoCRM Client ID and Secret",
                "495: ",
                "496: 1. Open [Zoho API Console](https://api-console.zoho.com/) and sign into your account, or create a new one.",
                "497: 2. From within the API console page, go to \"Applications\".",
                "498: 3. Click \"ADD CLIENT\" button top right and select \"Server-based Applications\".",
