                "510: ",
                "511: ## Workflows",
                "512: ",
                "513: ### Setting up SendGrid for Email reminders",
                "514: ",
                "515: 1. Create a SendGrid account (https://signup.sendgrid.com/)",
                "516: 2. Go to Settings -> API keys and create an API key",
                "517: 3. Copy API key to your `.env` file into the `SENDGRID_API_KEY` field",
                "518: 4. Go to Settings -> Sender Authentication and verify a single sender",
                "519: 5. Copy the verified E-Mail to your `.env` file into the `SENDGRID_EMAIL` field",
                "520: 6. Add your custom sender name to the `.env` file into the `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENDGRID_SENDER_NAME` field (fallback is Cal.com)",
                "521: ",
                "522: ### Setting up Twilio for SMS reminders",
                "523: ",
                "524: 1. Create a Twilio account (https://twilio.com/try-twilio)",
                "525: 2. Click ‘Get a Twilio phone number’",
                "526: 3. Copy Account SID to your `.env` file into the `TWILIO_SID` field",
                "527: 4. Copy Auth Token to your `.env` file into the `TWILIO_TOKEN` field",
                "528: 5. Copy your Twilio phone number to your `.env` file into the `TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER` field",
                "529: 6. Add your own sender ID to the `.env` file into the `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENDER_ID` field (fallback is Cal.com)",
                "530: 7. Create a messaging service (Develop -> Messaging -> Services)",
                "531: 8. Choose any name for the messaging service",
                "532: 9. Click 'Add Senders'",
                "533: 10. Choose phone number as sender type"
            ]
