            "context": [
                "8:   - List and rearrange your bookings eg. \"Cancel my next meeting\"",
                "9:   - Answer basic questions about your busiest times eg. \"How does my Tuesday look?\"",
                "10: ",
                "11: The core logic is contained in [agent/route.ts](/apps/ai/src/app/api/agent/route.ts). Here, a [LangChain Agent Executor](https://docs.langchain.com/docs/components/agents/agent-executor) is tasked with following your instructions. Given your last-known timezone, working hours, and busy times, it attempts to CRUD your bookings.",
                "12: ",
                "13: _The AI agent can only choose from a set of tools, without ever seeing your API key._",
                "14: ",
                "15: Emails are cleaned and routed in [receive/route.ts](/apps/ai/src/app/api/receive/route.ts) using [MailParser](https://nodemailer.com/extras/mailparser/).",
                "16: ",
                "17: Incoming emails are routed by email address. Addresses are verified by [DKIM record](https://support.google.com/a/answer/174124?hl=en), making it hard to spoof them.",
                "18: ",
                "19: ## Getting Started",
                "20: ",
                "21: ### Development",
                "22: ",
                "23: If you haven't yet, please run the [root setup](/README.md) steps.",
                "24: ",
                "25: Before running the app, please see [env.mjs](./src/env.mjs) for all required environment variables. You'll need:",
